{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"decode"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"I"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"input","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"I","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7UnicodeO5UTF32O6decodeys0A14DecodingResultOxzStRzs6UInt32V7ElementRtzlF1IL_xmfp","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnicodeDecodingResult","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UnicodeDecodingResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:s21UnicodeDecodingResultO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"I","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"IteratorProtocol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/IteratorProtocol","preciseIdentifier":"s:St","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"I","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/IteratorProtocol\/Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:St7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" == ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt32","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UInt32","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt32V","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"input","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An iterator of code units to be decoded. ","type":"text"},{"code":"input","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" must be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same iterator instance in repeated calls to this method. Do not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"advance the iterator or any copies of the iterator outside this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnicodeDecodingResult"},{"type":"text","text":" instance, representing the next"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unicode scalar, an indication of an error, or an indication that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"UTF sequence has been fully decoded."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To decode a code unit sequence completely, call this method repeatedly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"until it returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnicodeDecodingResult.emptyInput"},{"type":"text","text":". Checking that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"iterator was exhausted is not sufficient, because the decoder can store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffered data from the input iterator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because of buffering, it is impossible to find the corresponding position","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the iterator for a given returned ","type":"text"},{"code":"Unicode.Scalar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or an error.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example decodes the UTF-16 encoded bytes of a string"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into an array of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Unicode.Scalar"},{"type":"text","text":" instances. This is a demonstration"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only—if you need the Unicode scalar representation of a string, use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unicodeScalars"},{"text":" view.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ UTF-32 representation of \"✨Unicode✨\"","let codeUnits: [UTF32.CodeUnit] =","        [10024, 85, 110, 105, 99, 111, 100, 101, 10024]","","var codeUnitIterator = codeUnits.makeIterator()","var scalars: [Unicode.Scalar] = []","var utf32Decoder = UTF32()","Decode: while true {","    switch utf32Decoder.decode(&codeUnitIterator) {","    case .scalarValue(let v): scalars.append(v)","    case .emptyInput: break Decode","    case .error:","        print(\"Decoding error\")","        break Decode","    }","}","print(scalars)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"\\u{2728}\", \"U\", \"n\", \"i\", \"c\", \"o\", \"d\", \"e\", \"\\u{2728}\"]\""],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Starts or continues decoding a UTF-32 sequence.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/UTF32"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"Swift","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:s7UnicodeO5UTF32O6decodeys0A14DecodingResultOxzStRzs6UInt32V7ElementRtzlF","title":"decode(_:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"10.10","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","unava